1
00:00:00,297 --> 00:00:02,567
(Sheldon:)You know, on Vulcan,
when your brother asks,

2
00:00:02,566 --> 00:00:05,096
“Why are you hitting yourself?”
the answer is,

3
00:00:05,102 --> 00:00:06,472
“I'm not.

4
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:08,300
You're moving my arm.”

5
00:00:09,907 --> 00:00:10,837
(Sheldon:)To which he says,

6
00:00:10,841 --> 00:00:12,211
“Fascinating.”

7
00:00:12,209 --> 00:00:16,049
(Sheldon:)And then you both watch
educational television.

8
00:00:16,046 --> 00:00:17,846
(quietly): Aw. When he says
things like that,

9
00:00:17,848 --> 00:00:20,018
(Penny:)I just want to hug him
and make everything better.

10
00:00:20,017 --> 00:00:22,047
(Leonard:)My brother was
mean to me, too.

11
00:00:22,052 --> 00:00:23,722
(Penny:)Yeah, you probably
had it coming.

12
00:00:25,923 --> 00:00:27,793
(Adam:)Do you have
any Spock collectibles?

13
00:00:27,791 --> 00:00:28,861
(Sheldon:)I have many.

14
00:00:28,859 --> 00:00:31,289
(Sheldon:)My most treasured
is an autographed napkin

15
00:00:31,295 --> 00:00:34,025
(Sheldon:)given to me by my
very thoughtful friend Penny.

16
00:00:34,031 --> 00:00:35,361
(Sheldon:)That's her over there.

17
00:00:37,601 --> 00:00:39,801
Hi!

18
00:00:40,504 --> 00:00:41,834
(Penny:)Look at that.

19
00:00:41,838 --> 00:00:45,478
(Penny:)I'm in a movie,
my shirt stayed on.

20
00:00:45,475 --> 00:00:47,205
(Adam:)Can we see the napkin?

21
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,680
(Sheldon:)Of course. Excuse me.

22
00:00:48,679 --> 00:01:01,019
(Sheldon:)This will just take a moment.

